<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to auction T$30 bln government bonds in Oct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to auction T$30 bln government bonds in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-09-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's finance ministry said on Saturday it would auction T$30 billion in 10-year government construction bonds on October 18.</p>
<p>The coupon rate on the bonds is set at 6.80 percent.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
